[I] Command-line client component of the oo7 keyring project

[T] oo7 is a Rust implementation of the freedesktop.org Secret Service API.
[T] This package builds the `cli` sub-crate of the oo7 workspace, a
[T] command-line client for storing and retrieving secrets that replaces
[T] libsecret's `secret-tool`.

[U] https://github.com/linux-credentials/oo7

[A] Bilal Elmoussaoui
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/security

[L] MIT
